Type Error [E0204] in /tmp/zue_test_case.zu at line 6:
  cannot assign a float constant to 's', which is int

   2 |     let s = 0
     |             - 's' became int here
...
   6 |     s = 1.5
     |     -   ^^^ this is a float constant
     |     |
